121
00:08:24,820 --> 00:08:25,140
Hurry.

122
00:08:25,140 --> 00:08:30,840
Or else you'll lose your whole family again.

123
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:37,040
All I need to do is kill that big monster, right?

124
00:08:38,220 --> 00:08:40,360
That'll save everyone, including you.

125
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:42,600
You've always had the worst ideas.

126
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,340
Use your damn head for once.

127
00:08:44,900 --> 00:08:45,720
That thing's huge.

128
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:46,960
No one can kill it.

129
00:08:47,540 --> 00:08:48,220
Maybe not.

130
00:08:48,540 --> 00:08:49,760
But I'll sure as hell try.

131
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:49,840
Okay.

132
00:08:55,140 --> 00:08:58,340
You don't.

133
00:09:04,340 --> 00:09:06,280
You really want to save them that badly?

134
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:07,180
Yep.

135
00:09:07,900 --> 00:09:09,840
I'm afraid my power won't be enough.

136
00:09:10,260 --> 00:09:10,660
I know.

137
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:13,000
Then you're really here to betray me, huh?

138
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:14,900
You've come back for the golden trumpet.

139
00:09:15,680 --> 00:09:17,060
I told you it was bad news.

140
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,520
It's the only way.

141
00:09:18,520 --> 00:09:22,000
If you use that thing, you'll lose your humanity.

142
00:09:22,460 --> 00:09:23,760
You'll become something else.

143
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:26,260
Your family might not recognize you anymore.

144
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,180
I don't care.

145
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,740
Anything to keep them all safe.

146
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:48,900
Queen Cruel.

147
00:09:49,780 --> 00:09:50,720
This is bad.

148
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,920
They've stopped attacking us.

149
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,140
What's going on?

150
00:10:02,780 --> 00:10:03,960
Maybe that thing's to blame.

151
00:10:04,700 --> 00:10:06,040
Probably a safe bet.

152
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:10,920
It's you.

153
00:10:15,220 --> 00:10:15,820
You.

154
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,480
My sister.

155
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:19,300
Please.

156
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,940
You've got to help her.

157
00:10:20,940 --> 00:10:33,260
