159
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,180
We're getting new Seraph of the End readings.

160
00:10:37,940 --> 00:10:39,240
They're coming from the fire.

161
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,800
Well, what does that mean?

162
00:10:42,180 --> 00:10:42,920
