163
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:45,600
But, sir, if we fail to investigate it...

164
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:48,040
...then we might watch the world end again, right?

165
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,320
This must be heaven's wrath.

166
00:10:51,780 --> 00:10:54,600
But, even if God himself is our enemy...

167
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,700
...humankind will defeat him here.

168
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:58,660
Aoi.

169
00:10:59,320 --> 00:10:59,720
Sir.

170
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:01,260
Destroy it.

171
00:11:01,820 --> 00:11:02,260
Sir.

172
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:04,900
