Strike hard.

174
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,460
Destroy that Seraph.

175
00:11:08,460 --> 00:11:14,000
You too, Abaddon.

176
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,160
Abaddon!

177
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:32,080
Abaddon!

178
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:34,300
You too, Abaddon!

179
00:11:34,300 --> 00:11:38,340
Abaddon!

180
00:11:39,340 --> 00:11:41,340
The time has come to end this world.

181
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:47,340
I'll judge every human who's broken our taboos

182
00:11:47,340 --> 00:11:49,340
and turned them into pillars of salt.

183
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:55,340
What the fuck?

184
00:11:55,340 --> 00:11:56,340
Get out of the way!

185
00:11:56,340 --> 00:11:57,340
We don't have time!

186
00:11:58,340 --> 00:11:59,340
Fire!

187
00:12:09,340 --> 00:12:11,340
That's the second trumpet!

188
00:12:12,340 --> 00:12:13,340
Lieutenant Shinro Furuto!

189
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:14,340
It's the King of Salt!

190
00:12:15,340 --> 00:12:16,340
I don't care!

191
00:12:16,340 --> 00:12:17,340
Kill him!

192
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:39,340
Kill him!

193
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:46,340
Fully!

194
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:54,340
No!

195
00:12:57,340 --> 00:12:59,340
No!

196
00:13:08,340 --> 00:13:10,980
stop

197
