Now.

200
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:37,540
Now.

201
00:13:40,980 --> 00:13:41,780
You.

202
00:13:43,340 --> 00:13:44,460
It's over.

203
00:13:45,300 --> 00:13:49,060
The lust for power that drives you humans ends today.

204
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,220
All before me will become pillars of salt.

205
00:14:10,980 --> 00:14:15,700
All units. Target Yuichiro Hyakuya. Capture him, sir!

206
00:14:17,780 --> 00:14:22,180
Whoa, interesting. You've gone crazy. Welcome to the club.

207
00:14:23,540 --> 00:14:25,380
Humans aren't worthy of this world.

208
00:14:28,580 --> 00:14:33,380
You're losing sight of your goals, Yu. I said I'd help you get your vengeance.

209
00:14:34,900 --> 00:14:38,420
Unfortunately, right now, there's only one way for me to do that.

210
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,060
I have to take complete control.

211
00:14:47,940 --> 00:14:50,100
Not good. We have to get him.

212
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:52,580
We should go too, Queen Kru.

213
00:14:53,220 --> 00:14:54,260
Are you healed enough?

214
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:56,580
I'll be fine.

215
00:14:57,300 --> 00:15:01,620
Good. Don't let the humans get a hold of him. You've seen what they'll do.

216
00:15:01,620 --> 00:15:01,940
Right.

217
00:15:08,420 --> 00:15:09,140
I'm not done yet.

218
00:15:09,140 --> 00:15:12,340
Really? Because I meant to differ.

219
00:15:16,580 --> 00:15:20,740
My queen, you've panicked and left your beautiful neck wide open.

220
00:15:26,020 --> 00:15:26,660
Queen Kru!

221
00:15:26,660 --> 00:15:27,380
Forget me!

222
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:29,460
Mika, go!

223
00:15:30,740 --> 00:15:31,380
Now!

224
00:15:31,380 --> 00:15:52,100
That's better.

225
00:15:53,540 --> 00:15:54,260
Wow, Ferret.

226
00:15:54,900 --> 00:15:56,900
You've captured the queen. Impressive.

227
00:15:56,900 --> 00:15:58,740
I guess I was a good distraction.

228
00:15:58,740 --> 00:16:00,820
You sound as though you doubted me.

229
00:16:00,820 --> 00:16:01,620
I'm curious.

230
00:16:02,260 --> 00:16:05,780
Where does that leave us, now that our leader has been taken out of the equation?

231
00:16:05,780 --> 00:16:11,380
Listen, vampire brethren.

232
00:16:12,100 --> 00:16:16,500
We've just discovered that Krul Tepesh is guilty of high treason against our kind.

233
00:16:16,980 --> 00:16:21,700
She was involved in the human serif of the end experiment that could have completely destroyed us.

234
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:29,220
Therefore, as the seventh progenitor, I, Ferret Bathory, am assuming control.

235
00:16:32,740 --> 00:16:37,300
Oh, so you're still alive. I'm glad you managed to make it out of this okay.

236
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:42,340
Narumi, I'm short on time. Hurry up and give him to me.

237
00:16:43,300 --> 00:16:44,660
I'm sorry, Lieutenant Colonel.

238
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:49,140
But I can't follow your orders. Not after what you've done.

239
00:16:55,140 --> 00:16:56,100
What are you doing?

240
00:16:56,100 --> 00:16:58,820
Take him!

241
00:16:59,940 --> 00:17:00,660
Step aside.

242
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:10,260
Don't let them escape!

243
00:17:10,260 --> 00:17:12,500
Lieutenant General, they're coming.

244
00:17:17,380 --> 00:17:19,860
Always more vampires. Kill them!

245
00:17:19,860 --> 00:17:31,940
What the hell's going on, Gurren?

246
00:17:34,740 --> 00:17:37,700
Don't laugh at me. Explain yourself!

247
00:17:42,020 --> 00:17:43,620
You can't be mad at me, Shinya.

248
00:17:44,340 --> 00:17:47,300
I'm just doing what we dreamed about way back when we were kids.

249
00:17:47,860 --> 00:17:49,060
What are you talking about?

250
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:53,300
I'm changing the whole world. It's gonna be a different place.

251
00:17:53,300 --> 00:17:56,740
One where second tier people like you and me can actually move up.

252
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:58,580
Have you lost your mind?

253
00:17:58,580 --> 00:17:59,700
You killed our own men!

254
00:18:00,420 --> 00:18:03,380
Your betrayal destroyed us! Our comrades are dead!

255
00:18:06,100 --> 00:18:06,420
No.

256
00:18:08,420 --> 00:18:09,540
You've been possessed.

257
00:18:10,260 --> 00:18:13,300
Hey, listen to me. You're still in there somewhere!

258
00:18:16,100 --> 00:18:20,020
Shirawa, wait! What about Kamizuki's sister? She's still back there!

259
00:18:21,300 --> 00:18:21,780
It's okay.

260
00:18:21,780 --> 00:18:24,260
Are you sure?

261
00:18:28,660 --> 00:18:31,780
Hand over Yuichiro Hyakuya immediately. That's an order.

262
00:18:32,660 --> 00:18:37,540
We no longer take orders from you. As of now, my team's withdrawn from the demon army.

263
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:45,140
More will follow them. Hurry!

264
00:18:47,540 --> 00:18:48,900
Move it as fast as you can!

265
00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:52,900
I'm not losing any more comrades today.

266
00:19:18,900 --> 00:19:30,740
Kuruto, sir. Everything's in order. We're ready to advance.

267
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:46,900
Excellent. Let's not waste any more time.

268
00:19:48,900 --> 00:20:02,900
Now this is where things get really interesting.

269
00:20:18,900 --> 00:20:20,900
We're ready to go.

270
00:20:22,100 --> 00:20:23,220
Is that the last of it?

271
00:20:23,780 --> 00:20:24,100
Yeah.

272
00:20:24,660 --> 00:20:25,700
Where are those two?

273
00:20:26,580 --> 00:20:27,940
They'll be out in just a minute.

274
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:33,060
We're taking your time.

275
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:35,460
You're always in a rush, that's all.

276
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:49,060
You. Where's your demon?

277
00:20:50,100 --> 00:20:50,340
Oh.

278
00:20:51,460 --> 00:20:51,940
Sleeping.

279
00:20:52,660 --> 00:20:53,540
Don't worry about it.

280
00:20:53,540 --> 00:20:56,260
